---
import Section from "../Section.astro";
---

<Section
  id="about"
  eyebrow="02 / About"
  title="History is a living dialogue."
  tone="cream"
>
  <div class="grid gap-8 sm:gap-[8vw] md:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="about-lead">
      <p
        class="m-0 max-w-[16ch] font-display text-[clamp(1.8rem,3vw,3rem)] leading-tight"
      >
        I am an educator and researcher exploring how cultures, environments,
        and knowledge systems have shaped one another across the Americas.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-[58ch] text-[1.05rem] leading-7">
      <p class="mt-0">
        My work sits at the crossroads of history, ecology, and community
        engagement, revealing how Afrodescendant, Indigenous, and local actors
        navigated and transformed extractive colonial worlds.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6">
        My forthcoming book, <em
          >Copper Legacies: Environment, Labor, and Empire in Cuba under the
          Spanish Habsburgs</em
        >, traces the entanglement of metallurgy, slavery, and environmental
        change in the seventeenth-century Caribbean.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6">
        As a teacher, I bridge research and practice through service-learning
        and public-facing pedagogy, connecting classroom inquiry to questions of
        justice, sustainability, and intercultural understanding.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
